			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741360401,
					"content": "原來他之前一直重複著「五」，是為了告訴我們解謎的方式啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360402,
					"content": "明明直接告訴我們就好了，為什麼要這麼彆扭呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360403,
					"content": "哼，誰知道這傢伙在打什麼鬼主意…不過，他好像一直在引導我們去找納克。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360404,
					"content": "這些潛水服就放在那間屋子旁邊，簡直就像是專門為我們準備的一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360405,
						741360406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360405,
					"content": "看來，是他找到了我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741360407,
					"content": "沒有研究價值…我…我花了那麼多心思…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360408,
					"content": "菲希里耶小姐…碎碎唸了一整路呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360409,
					"content": "#不過…{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}有沒有一種被人盯著的感覺？我、我總覺得背後毛毛的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360410,
					"content": "…我走第一個，繼續往裡面探走走看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360406,
					"content": "無論如何，先處理納克。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360407
					]
				}
			]
		},
