			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741360601,
					"content": "好大一片空地，裡面…什麼也沒有。我們不會撲了個空吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360602,
					"content": "這周圍的植物被刻意清理過，修剪的痕跡還很新。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360603,
					"content": "…虧我還專門為他蹚這灘渾水…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360604,
					"content": "#總之我先一個人下去看看，{F#妳}{M#你}們就陪著科學院小姐，如果情勢太差…就趕快帶她走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360605,
					"content": "但這裡什麼東西也沒有，情勢再差應該也差不到哪裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360606,
					"content": "吱——嘎嘎——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360607,
					"content": "嗚哇！小心那邊！有東西衝過來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
